            "optimization-and-schedules",
            "dropout",
            "data-pipelines-and-training-loop",
            "monitoring-and-debugging",
            "performance-and-profiling",
            "lab-4"
          ],
          "summary": "From a training loop that runs to a training loop that works: layers, initialisation, normalisation, regularisation, schedules, monitoring, and the profiling that tells you where the time actually goes.",
          "title": "Session 4 \u2014 Advanced Neural Networks with PyTorch"
        },
        "s5-computer-vision-1": {
